<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Compass interim shr slips, div steady.</title>
<headline>Compass interim shr slips, div steady.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Sept 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     4.60	  vs  5.06</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 4.50	  vs  4.50</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   0.41	  vs  0.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.45	  vs  0.54</p>
<p>    Interest payable	3.77	  vs  2.53</p>
<p>    Turnover		 32.70	  vs 29.93</p>
<p>Div payable Dec 20</p>
<p>on register Nov 22</p>
<p>Full name: Compass Property Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said that full year results were expected to show a slight decrease on that reported for last year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
